{"seq":2,"slug":"graph-network-simulators","title":"Graph Network Simulators (GNS) 图网络模拟器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/world-models-simulation/neural-simulators/graph-network-simulators","wordCount":1825,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"graph-network-simulators-gns-图网络模拟器\">Graph Network Simulators (GNS) 图网络模拟器</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Graph Network Simulators（GNS）是用图神经网络仿真物理系统的方法。其核心思想是把物理系统抽象为图——节点表示粒子或刚体，边表示相互作用，用 GNN 在图上传递信息更新节点状态。这一抽象自然契合物理系统的局部相互作用特性（粒子之间的力只与邻居相关），并提供了对粒子数量、空间结构变化的天然鲁棒性。GNS 由 DeepMind 在 2020 年提出后迅速成为流体、布料、刚体接触等复杂介质仿真的主流方法。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[GNS 流程] --&gt; B[粒子离散化]&#10;    B --&gt; C[构建邻居图]&#10;    C --&gt; D[GNN 信息传递]&#10;    D --&gt; E[预测每粒子加速度]&#10;    E --&gt; F[积分更新位置/速度]&#10;    F --&gt; C\">graph TD\n    A[GNS 流程] --&gt; B[粒子离散化]\n    B --&gt; C[构建邻居图]\n    C --&gt; D[GNN 信息传递]\n    D --&gt; E[预测每粒子加速度]\n    E --&gt; F[积分更新位置/速度]\n    F --&gt; C</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>应用场景</th>\n<th>GNS 优势</th>\n<th>传统方法局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>流体仿真</td>\n<td>数据驱动，处理复杂相变</td>\n<td>SPH 等传统方法计算昂贵</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>布料/绳索</td>\n<td>端到端可微，易于优化</td>\n<td>显式弹性体方程难以求解</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>刚体接触</td>\n<td>自然处理多体接触</td>\n<td>LCP 求解器复杂、慢</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>粒状介质</td>\n<td>能仿真沙子、谷物等</td>\n<td>需要专门的分子动力学</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"图表示与消息传递\">图表示与消息传递</h2><p>GNS 的核心是把物理系统建模为图 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>V</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G = (V, E)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>节点 V</strong>：每个粒子是一个节点，节点特征包括位置、速度、材料类型、约束等。</li>\n<li><strong>边 E</strong>：邻居粒子之间有边连接，边特征包括相对位置、距离等。</li>\n<li><strong>全局特征</strong>：场景级属性（重力方向、外力场等）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>每一步仿真包含一次完整的图更新（message passing）：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[节点 V_i] --&gt; B[聚合邻居信息]&#10;    C[边 E_ij] --&gt; B&#10;    B --&gt; D[更新 V_i]&#10;    D --&gt; E[更新边 E_ij]&#10;    E --&gt; F[多轮迭代]\">graph LR\n    A[节点 V_i] --&gt; B[聚合邻居信息]\n    C[边 E_ij] --&gt; B\n    B --&gt; D[更新 V_i]\n    D --&gt; E[更新边 E_ij]\n    E --&gt; F[多轮迭代]</pre><p>具体的更新规则：</p>\n<p><strong>边更新</strong>：每条边根据自身特征和两端节点特征计算新边特征： </p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e&#x27;_{ij} = \\phi_e(e_{ij}, v_i, v_j, u)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.185em;vertical-align:-0.3831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>节点更新</strong>：每个节点聚合所有连接边的信息： </p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mi>v</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mtext>aggr</mtext><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msubsup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v&#x27;_i = \\phi_v(v_i, \\text{aggr}_j(e&#x27;_{ij}), u)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0489em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.185em;vertical-align:-0.3831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">aggr</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3802em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>经过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 轮迭代后，最终的节点特征用于预测每个粒子的加速度，再通过显式积分更新粒子位置与速度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"关键设计-邻居动态构建\">关键设计：邻居动态构建</h2><p>GNS 的一个核心设计决策是邻居图的构建方式。物理粒子的邻居关系随时间动态变化（粒子在移动），不能用固定图。常见的构建方式：</p>\n<p><strong>半径搜索</strong>：每一步重新计算每个粒子的固定半径内邻居。简单但 O(N²) 复杂度。</p>\n<p><strong>KDTree / 八叉树</strong>：用空间数据结构加速邻居查询，复杂度降到 O(N log N)。</p>\n<p><strong>网格哈希</strong>：把空间分成均匀网格，把粒子分配到网格 cell，只在邻近 cell 中找邻居。复杂度 O(N)，是当前最快的方法。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[邻居图构建] --&gt; B[半径搜索 O N²]&#10;    A --&gt; C[空间数据结构 O NlogN]&#10;    A --&gt; D[网格哈希 O N]&#10;    B --&gt; E[小规模通用]&#10;    C --&gt; F[中规模]&#10;    D --&gt; G[大规模主流]\">graph TD\n    A[邻居图构建] --&gt; B[半径搜索 O N²]\n    A --&gt; C[空间数据结构 O NlogN]\n    A --&gt; D[网格哈希 O N]\n    B --&gt; E[小规模通用]\n    C --&gt; F[中规模]\n    D --&gt; G[大规模主流]</pre><p>邻居图的频率也是设计权衡——每步重建保证准确但慢，固定图快但忽略大形变。常见的折衷是每 K 步重建（K=5-10）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"deepmind-gns-开创性工作\">DeepMind GNS：开创性工作</h2><p>DeepMind 的 GNS 论文（2020）是这一方向的奠基工作。其关键贡献：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>统一框架</strong>：GNS 框架适用于流体、刚体、可形变物体、粒状介质等极其多样的系统。</li>\n<li><strong>大规模实验</strong>：在 7 种不同材料的仿真上验证，证明了通用性。</li>\n<li><strong>数据效率</strong>：GNS 在每种材料上只用几千条轨迹就能训练到高精度。</li>\n<li><strong>零样本泛化</strong>：训练在小尺度系统上的 GNS 能直接用于大尺度（更多粒子）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>DeepMind GNS 在数据驱动物理仿真上确立了图神经网络范式，成为后续大量工作的基础。</p>\n<h2 id=\"meshgraphnets-网格化扩展\">MeshGraphNets：网格化扩展</h2><p>MeshGraphNets（DeepMind, 2021）把 GNS 思想扩展到网格化系统——把物理系统建模为不规则三角网格而非粒子。这种扩展让 GNS 能处理：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>流体计算</strong>：在三角化的流体域上用 GNN 仿真，比粒子方法更精确。</li>\n<li><strong>结构力学</strong>：建筑、桥梁等结构在受力下的变形仿真。</li>\n<li><strong>布料动力学</strong>：把布料表示为三角网格，仿真折叠、撕裂等复杂动力学。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>MeshGraphNets 的关键创新是处理动态网格——网格在仿真中可能因为变形或撕裂而拓扑改变。这与 GNS 中的粒子相对简单的连接关系有本质区别。</p>\n<h2 id=\"工程实现要点\">工程实现要点</h2><p>把 GNS 用于实际项目的工程经验：</p>\n<p><strong>输入归一化</strong>：粒子位置、速度差异巨大，必须归一化到 [-1, 1] 或类似范围才能稳定训练。常见做法是用相对坐标（每步与上一步的差）而非绝对坐标。</p>\n<p><strong>长 rollout 训练</strong>：单步预测训练后，模型在多步 rollout 时容易累积误差。常见的训练技巧：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Pushforward</strong>：训练时把模型自己的预测作为下一步输入，而非真实数据。</li>\n<li><strong>添加噪声</strong>：在训练时给输入加噪声，让模型对预测误差鲁棒。</li>\n<li><strong>渐进式 rollout 长度</strong>：从 1 步开始训练，逐步增加到 K 步。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>边特征设计</strong>：边特征的设计对 GNS 性能影响巨大。常见的边特征包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>相对位置 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta x_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>距离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|\\Delta x_{ij}|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>相对速度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>v</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta v_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>是否在接触阈值内。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>多尺度图</strong>：对大规模系统，单层图传递无法快速传播全局信息。可以用粗到细的多尺度图——粗图传递全局信息，细图处理局部细节。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与传统物理仿真的对比\">与传统物理仿真的对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>传统仿真（SPH, FEM）</th>\n<th>GNS</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>物理保证</td>\n<td>强（基于方程）</td>\n<td>弱（数据驱动近似）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>速度</td>\n<td>慢（每步求解）</td>\n<td>快（前向传播）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复杂材料</td>\n<td>难（每种材料专门设计）</td>\n<td>易（数据驱动）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反向传播</td>\n<td>难（求解器不可微）</td>\n<td>易（端到端可微）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据需求</td>\n<td>不需要</td>\n<td>需要大量训练数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可解释性</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>GNS 在速度、复杂材料、反向传播上有显著优势，是 RL、控制优化、设计优化的理想工具。传统仿真在物理精确性上仍不可替代，是科学计算的标准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"在机器人中的应用\">在机器人中的应用</h2><p>GNS 已经被应用到多个机器人场景：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>抓取仿真</strong>：把物体表面建模为粒子图，用 GNS 仿真抓取过程的接触动力学。</li>\n<li><strong>柔性物体操作</strong>：仿真布料折叠、绳索打结等任务。</li>\n<li><strong>粒状介质处理</strong>：仿真挖掘、堆砌沙土等任务。</li>\n<li><strong>流体操作</strong>：仿真倒水、搅拌、流体输送等任务。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这些应用让机器人能在仿真中训练复杂操作，而不必每个材料都用专门的物理引擎。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Graph Network Simulators 是用图神经网络仿真物理系统的强大方法，特别擅长复杂材料（流体、布料、粒状介质）和需要可微的场景。核心思想——把物理系统抽象为图、用 GNN 传递信息——简洁但通用，让 GNS 框架适用于多样的物理问题。从 DeepMind GNS 的奠基到 MeshGraphNets 的网格扩展，方法不断进步。理解 GNS 的设计要点（图表示、邻居构建、消息传递、长 rollout 训练）能让研究者把这一工具用于具身智能的复杂仿真需求。把 GNS 与传统仿真协同使用——传统仿真做刚体，GNS 做柔性——是当前最实用的工程范式，也是机器人仿真技术栈的未来方向。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Graph Network Simulators (GNS) 图网络模拟器","id":"graph-network-simulators-gns-图网络模拟器"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"图表示与消息传递","id":"图表示与消息传递"},{"level":2,"text":"关键设计：邻居动态构建","id":"关键设计-邻居动态构建"},{"level":2,"text":"DeepMind GNS：开创性工作","id":"deepmind-gns-开创性工作"},{"level":2,"text":"MeshGraphNets：网格化扩展","id":"meshgraphnets-网格化扩展"},{"level":2,"text":"工程实现要点","id":"工程实现要点"},{"level":2,"text":"与传统物理仿真的对比","id":"与传统物理仿真的对比"},{"level":2,"text":"在机器人中的应用","id":"在机器人中的应用"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"神经物理：用神经网络逼近物理仿真","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/world-models-simulation/neural-simulators/neural-physics"},"next":{"title":"可微仿真","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/world-models-simulation/neural-simulators/differentiable-simulation"}}